        "quote": "(a) There is hereby created in the City a special fund to be known as the historic preservation fund. Moneys from the general fund, community block grant funds, transient guest tax funds, or funds from any other source legally available for such purpose shall be credited to this fund.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.100:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.25.100 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "d93a3762-aa77-52e5-bf2b-73d6a7d1fd33",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 464,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.100:block:1",
          "start": 286
        },
        "quote": "(b) Moneys shall be expended only on projects that facilitate tourism resulting from the preservation and promotion of the City’s historical assets, including but not limited to:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.100:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.25.100 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "901b4c79-0ebc-5d45-870d-eb9438bc578d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 699,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.100:block:2",
          "start": 465
        },
        "quote": "(1) Restoring and preserving sites listed on a local, State or national register of historic sites that are not private or primarily commercial in nature unless open or intended to be open to the public on a regularly scheduled basis.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.100:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.25.100 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "96b1e04b-52ab-525c-8c32-27e58e26fc9a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 743,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.100:block:3",
          "start": 700
        },
        "quote": "(2) Marketing the City’s historical assets.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.100:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.25.100 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
