          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.100:block:8",
          "start": 1309
        },
        "quote": "(2) Make recommendations to the City Manager who shall determine whether to approve disbursement of funds, other than transient guest tax funds, credited to the historic preservation fund for projects identified in subsection (b) of this section.",
